13
00:00:44.930 --> 00:00:45.790
Ayo pergi.

14
00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:50.320
Um... Kakek.

15
00:00:51.440 --> 00:00:53.590
Jika Sun-chul terlalu sibuk untuk datang,

16
00:00:54.590 --> 00:00:55.860
