17
00:00:56.520 --> 00:00:57.380
Ya.

18
00:00:57.820 --> 00:00:58.690
Oh.

19
00:00:59.440 --> 00:01:00.300
Ayo pergi.

20
00:01:02.720 --> 00:01:04.630
